Live on your management cluster: gpu-operator. Each delivery profile deploys the same objects to the same cluster. apply also writes handover.sh, which steps each live profile aside without removing anything, so the delivery profiles carry on alone; run it after apply.sh. See "If your profiles are live" in docs/user/onboard-your-sveltos-fleet.md.

Next: cub sveltos apply <the same input and options> --out <dir>, read <dir>/apply.sh, then run it.

